limit: The nine figures are those of study/r1/runtime-jit.md section 8 (lines 293-301), which the node does not cite. The 4,950-line class is the study's 'JIT in C' and includes page allocation and the C host side of the in-language emitter; the main ranges the study lists for it sum to 4,687 lines, a gap of 263 against the stated tolerance of 150. The other eight classes agree with their listed ranges within that tolerance.
by: r3/review-fkwu-runtime
at: 2026-11-24

